msgstr "ClientFence 在此伺服器上沒有足夠的檔案系統權限進行更新。請檢視以下問題並先解決，然後再嘗試更新。"

#: src/library/ClientFence/Update.php
msgid "ClientFence does not have sufficient filesystem permissions to perform the update. Resolve the reported issues before trying again."
msgstr "ClientFence 沒有足夠的檔案系統權限進行更新。請先解決所報告的問題，然後再試。"

#: src/modules/System/templates/admin/mod_system_update.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence downloads the release and checks it, then saves a backup of the database and of every file the release replaces in the server backups folder. It installs the release with maintenance mode on, updates the database and logs you out of the admin area. The site reopens as soon as the update is complete. If the database update needs attention, you will be asked to finalize it after logging back in."
msgstr "ClientFence 會下載並檢查發行版本，然後將資料庫及發行版本所取代的每個檔案備份到伺服器的備份資料夾。它會在維護模式下安裝發行版本、更新資料庫，並將您登出管理區。更新完成後網站會隨即重新開放。如資料庫更新需要處理，您重新登入後會被要求完成更新。"

#: src/modules/Extension/templates/admin/mod_extension_index.html.twig
